<title>UK: KfW sets 1.0 bln Czech crown one-year bond.</title>
<headline>KfW sets 1.0 bln Czech crown one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Woodcommerz.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KREDITANSTALT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     11.0	MATURITY    26.MAR.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.945   PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 25	SALE LIMITS US/UK/CZ/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.85	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KREDITANSTALT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> NOTES	BORROWER FULL NAME IS KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
